    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but a \"break\" doesn't fix the debt. it doesn't fix the fact that i'm a drain on their resources every single day. if i stay, the hole just gets deeper for them. if i'm gone, the drain stops. it's like... if a branch is killing the tree, the most helpful thing is to just cut it off so the rest can live. is that really so crazy to think?",
